/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link5\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">エンディング終了画面</a></td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>共通</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link3\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">設定差のある小役</a></td>\n                            <td>?????</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link4\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">CZ当選率</a></td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  