/tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/216</td>\n                            <td>1/271</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th rowspan=\"2\">設定</th>\n                            <th colspan=\"2\">出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>市場予測値</th>\n                            <th>技術介入(フル攻略)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.3%</td>\n                            <td>102.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>98.2%</td>\n                            <td>105.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>101.4%</td>\n                            <td>105.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>102.4%</td>\n                            <td>107.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>105.6%</td>\n                            <td>108.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>105.2%</td>\n                            <td>109.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n      \n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n<div class=\"contents\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n        <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n        <table border=\"1\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                    <th>記載</th>\n                </tr><tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        <a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"transitionScroll('https://slolaboratory.com/s%e8%9b%87%e5%96%b0%e5%a4%a2%e5%ad%90%e3%81%a8%e3%81%84%e3%81%86%e5%a5%b3-%e3%83%8f%e3%82%a4%e3%82%a8%e3%83%8a%ef%bc%9a%e8%a9%b3%e7%b4%b0%e6%83%85%e5%a0%b1/', 44);\">天井情報</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>AT間天井</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        打ち方\n                    </td>\n                    <td>準備中</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        <a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"transitionScroll('https://slolaboratory.com/s%e8%9b%87%e5%96%b0%e5%a4%a2%e5%ad%90%e3%81%a8%e3%81%84%e3%81%86%e5%a5%b3-%e3%83%8f%e3%82%a4%e3%82%a8%e3%83%8a%ef%bc%9a%e8%a9%b3%e7%b4%b0%e6%83%85%e5%a0%b1/');\">ハイエナ詳細情報</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>その他のハイエナ情報</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n</div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">数値詳細</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination1\">筐体の色</h3>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/jabami_kyoutai3.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <p>ネットお馴染みの筐体の色で偶奇が確定する仕様。青ならば奇数設定が、赤ならば偶数設定が確定。技術介入の難易度が変化するので要注目。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination2\">AT終了画面</h3>\n                <p>設定示唆パターンが存在する模様。珍しい画面が出たらその後の展開に注目。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\">エンディング終了画面</h3>\n                <p>エンディング終了画面は全部で4種類で、デフォルト以外なら特定設定濃厚となります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th width=\"70%\">画面</th>\n                            <th width=\"30%\">示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/jabami__59.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td>デフォルト</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/jabami__60.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td>設定3以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/jabami__61.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td>設定3以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/jabami__62.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td>設定5以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\">設定差のある小役</h3>\n                <p>詳細は不明だがベースに設定1で33.2G〜設定6で35.2Gという差が存在。払い出しのある小役に設定差があると推測されます。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\">CZ当選率</h3>\n                <p>通常時はレア役成立時に滞在状態によってCZ抽選が行われます。</p>\n                <p>当選時は前兆を経由して告知されます。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>非CZ高確率中</caption>\n                                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <th>設定</th>\n                                        <th width=\"35%\">弱レア役</th>\n                                        <th width=\"35%\">強レア役</th>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定1</td>\n                                        <td>4.9%</td>\n                                        <td>18.6%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定2</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"2\">5.7%</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"2\">21.0%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定3</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定4</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"3\">6.4%</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"3\">22.5%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定5</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定6</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>CZ高確率中</caption>\n                                <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <th>設定</th>\n                                        <th width=\"35%\">弱レア役</th>\n                                        <th width=\"35%\">強レア役</th>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定1</td>\n                                        <td>19.5%</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"6\">54.7%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定2</td>\n                                        <td>23.4%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定3</td>\n                                        <td rowspan=\"3\">24.2%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定4</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定5</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td>設定6</td>\n                                        <td>25.0%</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            </table>\n            <figcaption class=\"left\">(※)弱レア役…弱チェリー・スイカ・弱チャンス目</figcaption>\n            <figcaption class=\"left\">(※)強レア役…強チェリー・強チャンス目</figcaption>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>","shukeiHtml":"","columns":[{"id":42413,"title":"S蛇喰夢子という女 基本情報","date":"2023-12-22","cats":[54,57]},{"id":22225,"title":"S蛇喰夢子という女 有利区間転落条件考察","date":"2023-08-20","cats":[144,56,54]},{"id":22283,"title":"S蛇喰夢子という女 有利区間ゲーム数計算方法","date":"2023-08-20","cats":[144,56,54]},{"id":17516,"title":"S蛇喰夢子という女 ハイエナ：詳細情報","date":"2023-07-04","cats":[56,54,142]}]},"ev":null}